- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/34894ac73b02efefeacd9c0972780b32dc3de04f)
- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/9d804c54ce962408ae6418255a83a13924f7145d)

